code.description:
Different SKUs are not allowed to use the same identifier code. The rules for the identifier code are as follows:
-  GTIN: 14 digits, numbers only;
- EAN: 8, 13, 14 digits, numbers only;
- UPC: 12 digits, numbers only; 
- ISBN: 13 digits, and the last digit supports input X (uppercase)
- The GTIN code you enter should be registered with GS1.
